      {
        "index": 1,
        "text": "A coastal village became popular after a travel programme showed its narrow streets. Tourism brought customers to local shops, but residents also noticed more litter and pressure on public facilities. The council invited a guide named Rosa to help organise a discussion about the village's future.",
        "zh": "一档旅游节目展示了一座沿海村庄狭窄的街道，此后村庄走红了。旅游为商店带来了顾客，但居民也发现垃圾增多，公共设施承受了更大压力。地方议会邀请导游罗莎帮助组织一场关于村庄未来的讨论。",
        "start": 4.26,
        "voiceEnd": 28.206666666666663,
        "end": 52.15333333333333,
