      {
        "index": 2,
        "text": "The residents, whose homes stood near the main square, described the busiest weekends. Some welcomed the extra income; others worried about the loss of quiet spaces. The harbour, where many visitors gathered, needed better signs and bins. Rosa recorded both benefits and costs instead of treating all opinions as identical.",
        "zh": "住在主广场附近的居民讲述了最繁忙的周末。有些人欢迎额外收入，另一些人担心安静空间的流失。许多游客聚集的港口需要更清晰的标识和更多垃圾桶。罗莎记录了好处和代价，没有把所有意见当作一样。",
        "start": 52.153333333333336,
        "voiceEnd": 80.18333333333334,
