      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "A local museum proposed an exhibition about the village's heritage. Craftspeople could demonstrate traditional skills, provided that the events respected their working hours. The council considered a modest visitor charge to help maintain facilities. Before reaching a decision, it asked how the money would be spent and who would benefit.",
        "zh": "当地博物馆提议举办村庄文化遗产展。只要活动尊重工作时间，手艺人就可以展示传统技能。议会考虑收取少量游客费用，用于维护设施。决定之前，议会询问资金将如何使用，以及谁会受益。",
