      {
        "index": 4,
        "text": "Rosa suggested a plan that encouraged visitors to stay longer and explore beyond the main square. Clearer guidance could reduce overcrowding without closing the village to outsiders. The aim was to make tourism sustainable while protecting the community's character. Residents would review the arrangement at the end of the season.",
